<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AAA to L-Bank dual samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AAA to L-Bank dual samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Monday that it had assigned its AAA rating to Landeskreditbank Baden-Wuerttemberg's (L-Bank) 20 billion yen worth of three percent reverse yen-Australian dollar dual-currency bonds due April 24, 2007.</p>
<p>The rating outlook is stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
